      "title": "Why a handler receives both the Spot and the Actor",
      "items": [
        "An Actor always belongs to some Spot. The place it lands right after creation is the Entry Spot, and entering a room moves it to that User Spot.",
        "So a message sent to an actor id runs inside the Spot that Actor belongs to now, and the handler receives both the Spot and the Actor."
